                  <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> Rómulo Rojo Vivot</span>
                  <span><i class="bi bi-newspaper"></i> La Ley – Thomson Reuters Argentina</span>
                  <span><i class="bi bi-calendar-event-fill"></i> 09/10/2025</span>
                </p>
